  "content": "<p><img src=\"http://i.imgur.com/kUbPW7K.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"726\" height=\"360\"></p><p>Custom NPCs 是一個用來活化世界或創造自己冒險的模組。</p><p>它提供工具來創建NPC，並調整他們的生命值/力量/武器/外觀和AI。</p><p><strong>資訊</strong></p><ul>\n<li><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=http%253a%252f%252fwww.kodevelopment.nl%252fminecraft%252fcustomnpcs%252f\" rel=\"nofollow\">入門資訊</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=http%253a%252f%252fwww.kodevelopment.nl%252fminecraft%252fcustomnpcs%252finstallation\" rel=\"nofollow\">安裝指南</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=http%253a%252f%252fwww.kodevelopment.nl%252fminecraft%252fcustomnpcs%252ffaq\" rel=\"nofollow\">常見問題</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=http%253a%252f%252fwww.kodevelopment.nl%252fminecraft%252fcustomnpcs%252fchangelog\" rel=\"nofollow\">更新日誌</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=http%253a%252f%252fwww.kodevelopment.nl%252fminecraft%252fcustomnpcs%252fitems\" rel=\"nofollow\">物品</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=http%253a%252f%252fwww.kodevelopment.nl%252fminecraft%252fcustomnpcs%252fdialog\" rel=\"nofollow\">對話設定</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=http%253a%252f%252fwww.kodevelopment.nl%252fminecraft%252fcustomnpcs%252ffactions\" rel=\"nofollow\">陣營設定</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=http%253a%252f%252fwww.kodevelopment.nl%252fminecraft%252fcustomnpcs%252froles\" rel=\"nofollow\">角色</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=http%253a%252f%252fwww.kodevelopment.nl%252fminecraft%252fcustomnpcs%252fjobs\" rel=\"nofollow\">職業</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=http%253a%252f%252fwww.kodevelopment.nl%252fminecraft%252fcustomnpcs%252fmaps\" rel=\"nofollow\">冒險地圖</a></li>\n</ul><p>更多問題請加入我的Discord：<a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=http%253a%252f%252fkodevelopment.nl%252fdiscord\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://img.shields.io/discord/151785576557707264\" alt=\"\" width=\"108\" height=\"20\"></a></p><p>想支持我嗎？成為我的贊助者：</p><p><a href=\"https://www.patreon.com/Noppes\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"http://i.imgur.com/S7MWUBK.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"552\" height=\"136\"></a></p>",
